{"id":"a9b8c5e3158341a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Mixing Transformation","display":"df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation — ZFC Measure7 Mixing Transformation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation — ZFC Measure7 Mixing Transformation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-measure-preserving]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation — ZFC Measure7 Mixing Transformation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"58-df-measure-preserving\">58-df-measure-preserving</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,E,F,N,n,\\varepsilon\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,E,F,N,n,\\varepsilon\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\\)</span> (measure-preserving predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"58-df-measure-preserving\">58-df-measure-preserving</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MixingTransformation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MixingTransformation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}mixing\\text{-}transformation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MixingTransformation}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall E,F\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\bigl|\\mu((T^n)^{-1}[E]\\cap F)-\\mu(E)\\mu(F)\\bigr|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}mixing\\text{-}transformation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MixingTransformation}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall E,F\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\bigl|\\mu((T^n)^{-1}[E]\\cap F)-\\mu(E)\\mu(F)\\bigr|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mixing requires asymptotic independence of every two measurable events under iterates of a measure-preserving self-map.</li>\n<li>The measure-preserving predicate is called with its actual four arguments.</li>\n<li>The convergence condition is expanded as an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>--<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> clause, so no unbound limit operator is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-preserving","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-preserving]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S$ (probability-space predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-preserving","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S$ (measure-preserving predicate, see [[58-df-measure-preserving]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,E,F,N,n,\\varepsilon\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MixingTransformation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}mixing\\text{-}transformation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MixingTransformation}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\forall E,F\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\bigl|\\mu((T^n)^{-1}[E]\\cap F)-\\mu(E)\\mu(F)\\bigr|<\\varepsilon\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false}],"bytes":1751,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2638","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation.md|58-df-zfc-measure7-mixing-transformation]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","785c80475c01fc69","d4d304b0bbb11c1a"]}